  "content": "\n\n<h4>此資源包透過<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>發光效果</strong>,</span>提升了工具的附魔光澤，讓它們看起來更加鮮豔且時尚。</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-with-hold-my-items-mod.webp\" alt=\"Sinnelar - 《附魔光效》Minecraft 資源包展示（搭配 Hold My Items 模組）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-bow.gif\" alt=\"Minecraft 附魔弓箭發光動畫\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-crossbow.gif\" alt=\"Minecraft 附魔弩箭發光動畫\" width=\"50%\">\n<br></p>\n<p>此資源包完全適用於&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Vanilla Minecraft 1.21.4 - 26.2</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>附魔工具清單：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>劍</li>\n<li>斧頭</li>\n<li>鎬子</li>\n<li>鏟子</li>\n<li>鋤頭</li>\n<li>長矛</li>\n<li>3D 戰錘</li>\n<li>弓</li>\n<li>弩</li>\n<li>釣竿</li>\n<li>三叉戟 (1.21.4+)</li>\n<li>盾牌 (1.21.4+)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">版本低於 1.21.4 需安裝 CIT Resewn<br></span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/ui/b-ct-d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"177\"></span></strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>致謝：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>是的，其靈感來自<strong>Actions &amp; Stuff</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<div>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3122\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/sinnelar-affiliates/sparked-host-promo-code-2026-minecraft-sinnelar.webp\" alt=\"Sparked Host 2026 優惠碼 - 使用代碼 Sinnelar 享受 Minecraft 伺服器主機 25% 折扣\" width=\"100%\">\n  </a>\n</div>",
